            "HELP_BODY", [|
                "  esd                      その場で診断して要約を表示（scan と同等）\n  esd scan [options]       診断を実行して結果を出力\n  esd diff [options] [files] 前回スナップショットとの差分のみを表示\n                           (例: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         新しいバージョンの有無を確認\n  esd update-defs          バージョン定義データ（runtimes/apps）を更新\n  esd version              バージョン情報を表示\n  esd help                 このヘルプを表示";
                "  esd                      Run diagnostics immediately and display summary (same as scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Run diagnostics and output results\n  esd diff [options] [files] Show only differences from the previous snapshot\n                           (e.g. esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Check whether a newer version is available\n  esd update-defs          Update version definition data (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Show version information\n  esd help                 Show this help";
                "  esd                      立即诊断并显示摘要（与 scan 相同）\n  esd scan [options]       执行诊断并输出结果\n  esd diff [options] [files] 仅显示与上次快照的差异\n                           (例: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         检查是否有新版本可用\n  esd update-defs          更新版本定义数据（runtimes/apps）\n  esd version              显示版本信息\n  esd help                 显示此帮助";
                "  esd                      立即診斷並顯示摘要（與 scan 相同）\n  esd scan [options]       執行診斷並輸出結果\n  esd diff [options] [files] 僅顯示與上次快照的差異\n                           (例: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         檢查是否有新版本可用\n  esd update-defs          更新版本定義資料（runtimes/apps）\n  esd version              顯示版本資訊\n  esd help                 顯示此說明";
                "  esd                      즉시 진단 후 요약 표시(scan과 동일)\n  esd scan [options]       진단을 실행하고 결과 출력\n  esd diff [options] [files] 이전 스냅샷과의 차이만 표시\n                           (예: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         새 버전 존재 여부 확인\n  esd update-defs          버전 정의 데이터(runtimes/apps) 업데이트\n  esd version              버전 정보 표시\n  esd help                 도움말 표시";
                "  esd                      Chẩn đoán ngay và hiển thị tóm tắt (giống scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Chạy chẩn đoán và xuất kết quả\n  esd diff [options] [files] Chỉ hiển thị khác biệt so với snapshot trước\n                           (vd: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Kiểm tra xem có phiên bản mới không\n  esd update-defs          Cập nhật dữ liệu định nghĩa phiên bản (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Hiển thị thông tin phiên bản\n  esd help                 Hiển thị trợ giúp này";
                "  esd                      Sofort diagnostizieren und Zusammenfassung anzeigen (wie scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Diagnose ausführen und Ergebnis ausgeben\n  esd diff [options] [files] Nur Änderungen zum vorherigen Snapshot anzeigen\n                           (z. B. esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Auf eine neuere Version prüfen\n  esd update-defs          Versionsdefinitionsdaten aktualisieren (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Versionsinformationen anzeigen\n  esd help                 Diese Hilfe anzeigen";
                "  esd                      Diagnostiquer immédiatement et afficher le résumé (comme scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Exécuter le diagnostic et afficher les résultats\n  esd diff [options] [files] Afficher uniquement les différences avec l’instantané précédent\n                           (ex. esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Vérifier si une nouvelle version est disponible\n  esd update-defs          Mettre à jour les données de définition (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Afficher les informations de version\n  esd help                 Afficher cette aide";
                "  esd                      Diagnosticar al instante y mostrar resumen (igual que scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Ejecutar diagnóstico y mostrar resultados\n  esd diff [options] [files] Mostrar solo diferencias respecto a la instantánea anterior\n                           (ej.: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Comprobar si hay una nueva versión disponible\n  esd update-defs          Actualizar los datos de definición (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Mostrar información de versión\n  esd help                 Mostrar esta ayuda";
                "  esd                      Esegui subito la diagnostica e mostra il riepilogo (come scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Esegui la diagnostica e stampa i risultati\n  esd diff [options] [files] Mostra solo le differenze rispetto allo snapshot precedente\n                           (es. esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Controlla se è disponibile una nuova versione\n  esd update-defs          Aggiorna i dati di definizione (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Mostra le informazioni sulla versione\n  esd help                 Mostra questa guida";
                "  esd                      Diagnosticar imediatamente e exibir resumo (igual ao scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Executar diagnóstico e exibir resultados\n  esd diff [options] [files] Mostrar apenas diferenças do snapshot anterior\n                           (ex.: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Verificar se há uma nova versão disponível\n  esd update-defs          Atualizar dados de definição (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Mostrar informações da versão\n  esd help                 Mostrar esta ajuda";
                "  esd                      Сразу выполнить диагностику и показать сводку (как scan)\n  esd scan [options]       Выполнить диагностику и вывести результат\n  esd diff [options] [files] Показать только отличия от прошлого снимка\n                           (напр.: esd diff / esd diff prev.json / esd diff a.json b.json)\n  esd update-check         Проверить наличие новой версии\n  esd update-defs          Обновить определения версий (runtimes/apps)\n  esd version              Показать версию\n  esd help                 Показать эту справку"
